# Kiwix ZIM files to download.  Format:  <folder on download.kiwix.org/zim/>  <file prefix>
# The script picks the newest file for each prefix. Comment a line out (#) to skip it.
# Sizes checked 2026-11-05 (GB). Total for the enabled lines: ~104 GB.

# --- Wikipedia (pick ONE) ---
wikipedia  wikipedia_en_all_nopic_        # 52.7  all articles, no images  <- default
#wikipedia wikipedia_en_all_maxi_         # 127   all articles with images (too big with everything else)
#wikipedia wikipedia_en_all_mini_         # 14.4  intro + infobox only (pick this to make room for Survivor Library)
wikipedia  wikipedia_en_medicine_maxi_    # 1.9   WikiMed, with images

# --- Survival / preparedness ---
other      zimgit-post-disaster_en_       # 0.6
other      zimgit-water_en_               # 0.02
other      zimgit-food-preparation_en_    # 0.1
other      zimgit-medicine_en_            # 0.07
other      zimgit-knots_en_               # 0.03
zimit      www.ready.gov_en_              # 2.4   FEMA Ready.gov
zimit      wwwnc.cdc.gov_en_all_          # 0.2   CDC travel health
#zimit     survivorlibrary.com_en_all_    # 220   Survivor Library (pre-industrial how-to books). Only fits with Wikipedia "mini".

